  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.0.1:\n\n## Changed\n- [Report Templates] Added an optional `mode` argument to the {{calc Round(number, digits, mode)}} function to control rounding behavior. (DOC-7287)\n- Supported rounding modes:\n  - \"banker\" / \"toeven\" (default): round half to even\n  - \"up\" / \"awayfromzero\": round half away from zero\n  - \"truncate\" / \"tozero\": truncate toward zero\n  - \"floor\" / \"down\": round toward negative infinity\n  - \"ceiling\" / \"ceil\": round toward positive infinity",
